        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "You must die by [different] causes of death to accumulate progress. Required distinct causes scale with players: 5 for 12-16 players, 8 at 32 players, linear between.",
            "zh_cn": "你需要以【不同】的死亡原因死去来累积胜利进度。需要的不同死因数量随人数变化：12-16 人为 5 种，32 人为 8 种，中间线性递增。",
            "zh_tw": "你需要以【不同】的死亡原因死去來累積勝利進度。需要的不同死因數量隨人數變化：12-16 人為 5 種，32 人為 8 種，中間線性遞增。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            1.8,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [
            2.2,
            1.5,
            3.0
          ],
